  (sets LD_LIBRARY_PATH for libamdhip64.so).

Models in `/mnt/data4/.hipfire/models/`:
- `qwen3.6-27b.mq4` (14 GB on disk, MQ4-G256 quant, **mtp.* tensors stripped
  by current quantizer**)
- `qwen36-27b-dflash-mq4.hfq` (877 MB, z-lab DFlash drafter — **not used by
