- llama.cpp at `/home/alpineq/projects/llama.cpp` (build at `build/bin/llama-server`,
  has `--spec-type mtp --spec-draft-n-max <N>`).

Bench prompts (canonical, all comparisons must use these md5s exactly per
CLAUDE.md prompt-md5 rule):
