1. This PRD.
2. `CLAUDE.md` (top-level project rules — coherence gates, prompt-md5
   discipline, MQ4 quantization, hetero rules).
3. `crates/hipfire-arch-qwen35/src/qwen35.rs` lines 70–340 (`Qwen35Config`,
   `Qwen35Weights`, layer structs).
4. `crates/hipfire-arch-qwen35/src/speculative.rs` lines 2403–3340
   (`spec_step_dflash`) — pattern to mirror for `spec_step_mtp`.
5. `/home/alpineq/projects/llama.cpp/src/models/qwen35_mtp.cpp` — the
   reference MTP graph. Read for tensor wiring, do NOT copy ggml code.
6. `https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.6-27B/raw/main/config.json` and
   `model.safetensors.index.json` — source of truth for tensor names
   and shapes.
